</code>

The given code reads the assert conditions from the comments which start with "@@@". These comments are part of assumptions provided by Pex, the C# automatic testing tool from Microsoft. The function "PUT_AddContract" is an example to show how assert statements can be generated for these assumptions. The method "IndexOf" in ArrayList searches for the first occurrence of the element in ArrayList and returns the index of the first occurrence found, returns -1 if it doesn't find the element. So, it is safe to assume that any new index would not be -1 and should be less than "New_arrListCount".--------------------

